WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.280
Imagine borrowing millions of dollars with no collateral, just for a few seconds. In

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:22.440
DeFi that's possible with flash loans. Flash loans happen in a single blockchain transaction.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.800
If everything succeeds, including repayment, it's confirmed. If not, it's like it never

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:33.680
happened. Why use a flash loan? To profit from price differences, refinance DeFi debt, or

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.280
liquidate positions without fronting capital? But flash loans can be used to attack poorly

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.640
secured protocols, manipulating prices, draining liquidity, and exploiting smart contracts.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:51.600
That's why protocols now use audits, price oracles, and real-time monitoring to catch suspicious

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:58.560
behaviour before it spreads. Flash loans unlock capital-free strategies and real-time automation.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:03.040
For developers, they're a tool. For DeFi, they're a revolution.
